A little while ago I was lucky and scored an early wish off a
fountain.Naturally I got +2 SDSM.
A short while later I ran across a polymorph trap and turned into a
female silver dragon.I had a huge food supply so I decided to get some
cool pets for later and laid a whole stack of eggs (about 30).when I
turned back into a human I headed over to minetown with my zoo in tow
(about 10 of them, I left the rest behind).Long story short minetown
had three bones with the following,3 BoH,magic marker,several cloak of
MR,2 boots of speed,Mjollnir,Excalibur and assorted other loot.I
thought this was a clear ascension.
Once again the RNG proved me wrong.
I had just about finished up minetown when I accidentally picked up a
cockatrice corpse without gloves.D'oh!

Luckily(?) this left a bones file.

A bones file with 10 (almost full grown) baby silver dragons.
Great.
several characters later...

A new rogue armed with some 40 daggers and expert with them arrived
and carefully dispatched the dragon horde with liberal usage of the E
word and dagger chucking.
The loot was mine. ("take that, RNG!", cries the Rogue, triumphantly).

Then while playing with my 2 BoHs (you can see this one coming a mile
away... The revenge of the RNG) amidst the flurry of keys and skipped
messages I saw ' you are engulfed in a magical explosion'!
AAAAHHHH!
I will never learn!
Never ever ever ever put a BoH into another BoH!

Oh well, at leat  got the +2 boots of speed and +2 SDSM, even if I did
blow up all of my scrolls, 20 potions of holy water, 2 magic markers,
about 30 rings!
And I still have another BoH (even if it is cursed and all of my
potions are gone)...

A mixed success indeed.

